# Windows 一键脚本一律不入库。分两类，但结论相同：
#  (1) 含本机信息的：0-setup / 1-run / 2-test / 3-build / 4-release / build-installer 等，
#      写死了盘符与本机缓存目录，属于本机产物；
#  (2) 通用的 start-mineradio.bat / quick-check.bat：内容只用 %~dp0 定位，本身不含本机信息，
#      但它们是 `npm start` 与 `npm run check:quick` 的包装，功能完全重复。放在仓库根目录会被
#      误读成"官方启动方式"（正式版用户拿到的是安装后的 Mineradio.exe，从不经过 bat），
#      因此改为仅本地保留。
# Windows one-click scripts never go into the repository. Two categories, same conclusion:
#  (1) machine-specific ones (0-setup / 1-run / 2-test / 3-build / 4-release / build-installer)
#      hardcode the drive letter and local cache directories;
#  (2) the generic start-mineradio.bat / quick-check.bat only resolve paths from %~dp0 and carry no
#      machine information, but they merely wrap `npm start` and `npm run check:quick`. At the
#      repository root they read as "the official way to launch", while a released build ships an
#      installed Mineradio.exe and never touches a .bat. Kept locally only.
0-setup.bat
1-run.bat
2-test.bat
3-build.bat
4-release.bat
build-installer.bat
start-mineradio.bat
quick-check.bat
5-diag-wallpaper.bat
_dryrun-diag.bat
wallpaper-diagnosis.txt

# 外部程序误写到工作区的产物（如手动跑 Wallpaper Engine 时它按 CWD 落下日志）
# Artifacts external programs drop into the working directory (Wallpaper Engine writes its log
# relative to the CWD when launched by hand).
log.txt
wallpaper-diagnosis.log

# ⚠️ 汽水音乐官方客户端的专有二进制：bdms.node / metasecml.dll 等一律不得入库，
#    也不得随安装包分发（授权缓存默认在用户主目录 ~/.mineradio/qishui-native，不在仓库内）。
#    These guard the repository in case a local cache is ever pointed at the working directory.
# Proprietary SodaMusic client binaries must never be committed or shipped.
qishui-native/
*.node
bdms.node
metasecml.dll
metasecml.dylib
libmetasecml.so

# ⚠️ 洛雪自定义音源脚本：第三方脚本一律不得入库，也不得随安装包分发。
#    运行时的脚本仓库在 Electron userData 下的 custom-sources/，正常不会出现在仓库里；
#    这几条只为防止把测试用的 userData 目录指向工作区后误提交用户的音源列表。
# LX custom source scripts must never be committed or shipped with the installer. The live
# store lives in custom-sources/ under Electron userData; these lines only guard against a
# test userData directory being pointed at the working tree.
custom-sources/
*.user.js

# ⚠️ 便携数据根目录：登录凭证、cookie、分区存储、缓存全部落在 <仓库>/userdata/ 下，
#    一律不得入库；这里兜底防止 git add -A 把用户凭据带上仓库。
# The portable data root holds credentials, cookies, partitions and caches; never commit it.
userdata/

# ⚠️ 本地工作区数据：一次性探针脚本、验证日志、截图、临时归档都落在 .workbuddy/ 下，
#    全部是本机专属产物（含绝对路径），不得入库。目录本身不要删 —— 里面还放着跨轮次的记录。
# Local workspace data: throwaway probes, verification logs, screenshots and temp archives land in
# .workbuddy/ — machine-specific, never committable. The directory itself must not be deleted.
.workbuddy/
